
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The <a href="https://relay.experience.stjude.org/">Relay for St. Jude 2026 fundraiser</a> is underway. Hooray! Since 2019, the Relay community has raised more than $4.8 million for St. Jude. This year, we&#8217;re within reach of the $5 million mark.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The case is simple. You give money and they use it to take care of kids with cancer. <a href="https://www.stjude.org/about-st-jude/unique-operating-model.html">Families never receive a bill from St. Jude</a> for treatment, travel, housing, or food. The hospital has also helped push the U.S. childhood cancer survival rate from 20% when St. Jude opened in 1962 to more than 80% today. Donors make that work possible. I plan on helping. You can too. Even five dollars helps.</p>
